 minor league RHP <Richard Holliday:player#12768> to <Kansas City:team#7> for 26-year old minor league RHP <Roger Nelson:player#8470>. \n\n\nThis year, <Collins:player#4620> is batting .109 with no home runs and 2 RBIs. In 34 games he has scored 0 times.\n\nSo far in his career, <Nelson:player#8470> has registered 1 save and fashioned a 11-17 won-lost mark. In 55 games he has fanned 157 batters in 272.2 innings and logged a 3.07 ERA."), (1140, "Baltimore-Kansas City Announce Swap", 4851, 12794, 2902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0, 0, 0, 100, 0, 3, 1, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, "1970-7-13", 0, 1, -1, 1, "Done deal! The <Baltimore Orioles:team#1> have agreed to send 21-year old minor league 2B <Enzo Hernandez:player#2902> and 23-year old minor league RHP <Bill Kirkpatrick:player#12794> to the <Kansas City Royals:team#7> for 34-year old RHP <Moe Drabowsky:player#4851>. The trade, rumored for days, was completed in the wee hours this morning.\n\n\nThis year, <Drabowsky:player#4851> has pitched 36.1 innings over 25 relief appearances, picking up no saves and held opponents to a .198 average. <Drabowsky:player#4851> has a 2-2 record with a 1.49 ERA and 24 strikeouts.");

